# 03-publish

## Purpose

Get the approved change live in both repos and in front of every harness.

## Inputs

| Source | Location | Why |
|---|---|---|
| `02-author` | `<run folder>/02-author/output/change-summary.md` | The branches to publish |
| The gate verdict | `<run folder>/02.1-qa/` | Proof the change passed |

## Process

1. Open a pull request in this repo and one in `{{qa_name}}`. Link each to the other and to the task record.
2. Merge both once the gate has passed and any required human yes is on the task record.
3. Add or update the runbook's row in `ROUTE.md`. Remove it for a retirement.
4. Run `python tools/graph.py .` to refresh `GRAPH.md`.
5. Run `python tools/sync.py . --target <harness skills folder>` for each harness.
6. Post the receipt on the task record.

## Output

Write to `<run folder>/03-publish/output/`. `deliverable.md` says what must be in it.
